!data/README.md

# Participant linking register — maps codes to real names, contact details and
# consent dates. This is the one file that de-anonymises the whole dataset, and
# committing it once puts it in the history permanently. The empty template
# (participant_register_template.csv) is safe and is tracked; anything else
# matching these names is not.
participant_register.csv
**/participant_register.csv
*_register_filled*
*_private.csv
